---
import { API_HOST, APP_HOST, APP_LOGIN_URL, APP_NAME, APP_REGISTER_URL, MARKETING_HOST } from '../lib/urls'
---

<footer class="border-t border-border-divider pb-10 pt-14">
  <div class="site-wrap grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr]">
    <div>
      <a href="#topo" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-title">
        <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="HOF Pay" width="32" height="32" class="size-8 rounded-[9px]" loading="lazy" />
        <span class="text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]">{APP_NAME}</span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-6 text-body">
        HOF Pay é a plataforma de gestão para clínicas. O site de marketing não pede login e não fala com a API —
        o produto vive no app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted">Produto</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-[15px]">
          <li><a class="text-body hover:text-title" href={APP_REGISTER_URL}>Criar clínica</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-body hover:text-title" href={APP_LOGIN_URL}>Entrar</a></li>
          <li><a class="text-body hover:text-title" href="#faq">FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-muted">Superfícies</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-[15px] text-body">
          <li>{MARKETING_HOST}</li>
          <li>{APP_HOST}</li>
          <li>{API_HOST}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[13px] text-muted">
    <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {APP_NAME}</p>
    <p>Estoque, protocolos, clientes, agenda e métricas.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
